		"本机记录每张命运卡的出现与选用次数:": "This device tracks how often each Fate Card appeared and was picked:",
		"普通模式 · 目标与身份": "Classic Mode — Goal & Ranks",
		"目标只有一个: [color=#7dd87d]尽快出完手牌[/color]!\n出完的先后决定身份 —— [color=#e0a83c]大富豪 → 富豪 → 贫民 → 大贫民[/color],\n身份带来不同积分, 多回合累积后统一结算。": "One goal: [color=#7dd87d]empty your hand first[/color]!\nFinishing order decides your rank — [color=#e0a83c]Tycoon → Millionaire → Pauper → Beggar[/color],\neach rank earns different points, tallied after all rounds.",
