		"每局按身份计分, 全部回合结束后统一结算\n胜者多拿钻石 —— 大富豪 +2 / 富豪 +1": "Points by rank each hand, tallied at the end\nWinners earn extra diamonds — Tycoon +2 / Millionaire +1",
